          "h1": "Wampler Pedals Leviathan Fuzz",
          "description": "Wampler Pedals Leviathan Fuzz is a fuzz pedal. Browse pictures, reviews and specs at Effects Database.",
          "snippet": "Wampler Pedals Leviathan Fuzz | Effects Database",
          "bodyExcerpt": "Wampler Pedals Leviathan Fuzz | Effects Database Skip to navigation Brands &#9660; 0-9... a... b... c... d... e... f... g... h... i... j... k... l... m... n... o... p... q... r... s... t... u... v... w... x... y... z... Effect types &#9660; boost distortion fuzz overdrive acoustic simulation amp simulation speaker/cabinet simulation chorus flanger phaser tremolo vibe vibrato other modulation pitch shifter octaver delay reverb looper/sampler hold/freeze eq filter wah fuzz-wah bitcrusher ring modulator samplerate reducer wavefolder synth effect granular effect multi effect vocal effect talkbox vocoder buffer compressor other... Countries &#9660; (country unknown) Argentina Australia Austria Belarus Belgium Brazil Bulgaria Canada Chile China Colombia Costa Rica Croatia Czech Republic Czechoslovakia DDR Denmark Dominican Republic Ecuador Egypt Estonia Finland France Germany Greece Hungary India Indonesia Iran Ireland Israel Italy Japan Latvia Lithuania Luxembourg Macedonia Malaysia Malta Mexico Moldova Monaco Morocco Netherlands New-Zealand Norway Panama Peru Philippines Poland Portugal Romania Russia Serbia Singapore Slovakia Slovenia South-Africa South-Korea Spain Sweden Switzerland Taiwan Thailand Turkey U.K. U.S.A. U.S.S.R. Ukraine Uruguay Venezuela Browse by &#9660; Enclosure type Modulation type Special &#9658; Classics Eye candy Funny Vaporware Weird Random brand Random effect Events &#9658; NAMM Musikmesse Music China Guitar Summit More... &#9660; Forum (opens in new tab) myFXDB (opens in new tab) Newsletter About How to get listed? Interviews Reviews Effects explained Books D.I.Y. Schematics Links Contact Install Effects Database App Search the database browse by brand I... IndyGuitarist Wampler Pedals browse by type distortion/fuzz/overdrive fuzz browse by enclosure pedal Wampler Pedals Leviathan Fuzz Published on March 5, 2011 Wampler Pedals fuzz pedal design design preview preview Information Wampler Pedals A consistent and versatile fuzz that unleashes your sound's inner monster. So, Wampler did what they always do, and Brian locked himself away emerging sometime later. It was clear he had created a monster. A pedal so aggressive, so tonally destructive Wampler seriously considered whether it was right to release it. What Wampler Pedals does is make pedals that retain your tone and add to it, not smash it into a million pieces. Once they had got over the sheer brutality of it, they noticed something strange, something about the sound. Brian had created an uber aggressive fuzz pedal: not only does it destroy your tone, it somehow also manages to retain it. Here it is, the Leviathan Fuzz, a true monster. With complete control over the tone: volume, gain, bass and treble and a switch that changes from a roar to a rumble feel. The switch takes you between GE and SI diodes, allowing you to more precisely shape the nature of the sound between a more compressed but gainier sound, or an open, throaty tone. Let your imagination guide you. Switch it a few times to get the hang of its sound, and from then on you'll know when you want to rumble, and when you want a roar! This is a true Wampler original, the circuit was born on the operating table in the Wampler basement, and you know if you turn your back on it for a second, it will bite. Features: Hand made in the USA High grade film capacitors and resistors picked for their superior sound and response Completely true bypass Battery connection and 9V power jack (barrel plug like Boss) Completely original design Switchable between GE and SI modes High gain, fuzzy and dynamic pedal Specifications: 2.5\" x 4.5\" (63.5mm x 114.3mm) Power draw: 12mA Video Date &#x25BC;&#x25B2; Maker &#x25BC;&#x25B2; Video &#x25BC;&#x25B2; Time &#x25BC;&#x25B2; 2016-06-02 reverbmarket Wampler Leviathan Fuzz Pedal 2:34 2015-03-09 MrExcane Wampler Pedals - Leviathan Fuzz - BASS Demo 8:08 2015-03-09 MrExcane Wampler Pedals - Leviathan Fuzz - GUITAR Demo 7:53 2012-12-24 Sweetwater Sound Wampler Leviathan Fu",
