          "bodyExcerpt": "Wampler Pedals Moxie Overdrive | Effects Database Skip to navigation Brands &#9660; 0-9... a... b... c... d... e... f... g... h... i... j... k... l... m... n... o... p... q... r... s... t... u... v... w... x... y... z... Effect types &#9660; boost distortion fuzz overdrive acoustic simulation amp simulation speaker/cabinet simulation chorus flanger phaser tremolo vibe vibrato other modulation pitch shifter octaver delay reverb looper/sampler hold/freeze eq filter wah fuzz-wah bitcrusher ring modulator samplerate reducer wavefolder synth effect granular effect multi effect vocal effect talkbox vocoder buffer compressor other... Countries &#9660; (country unknown) Argentina Australia Austria Belarus Belgium Brazil Bulgaria Canada Chile China Colombia Costa Rica Croatia Czech Republic Czechoslovakia DDR Denmark Dominican Republic Ecuador Egypt Estonia Finland France Germany Greece Hungary India Indonesia Iran Ireland Israel Italy Japan Latvia Lithuania Luxembourg Macedonia Malaysia Malta Mexico Moldova Monaco Morocco Netherlands New-Zealand Norway Panama Peru Philippines Poland Portugal Romania Russia Serbia Singapore Slovakia Slovenia South-Africa South-Korea Spain Sweden Switzerland Taiwan Thailand Turkey U.K. U.S.A. U.S.S.R. Ukraine Uruguay Venezuela Browse by &#9660; Enclosure type Modulation type Special &#9658; Classics Eye candy Funny Vaporware Weird Random brand Random effect Events &#9658; NAMM Musikmesse Music China Guitar Summit More... &#9660; Forum (opens in new tab) myFXDB (opens in new tab) Newsletter About How to get listed? Interviews Reviews Effects explained Books D.I.Y. Schematics Links Contact Install Effects Database App Search the database browse by brand I... IndyGuitarist Wampler Pedals browse by type distortion/fuzz/overdrive overdrive browse by enclosure pedal browse by enclosure mini pedal Wampler Pedals Moxie Overdrive Published on November 29, 2023 Wampler Pedals overdrive mini pedal pedal Information Wampler Pedals Wonderfully Warm and Rich - The Wampler Moxie Overdrive Guitar Pedal The Moxie overdrive is Brian Wampler's all new twisted take on a classic analog 'screamer style' overdrive circuit. Use it to pour out a cold shot of Texas Blues, add a little gravity to rhythm chops, or tighten up and push your lead channel into brutal high gain. The secret sauce of the Moxie lies within the two top-mounted toggle switches which Brian added to the existing circuit design. The Voice switch adds a unique singing clarity and removes that typical \"Mid-hump\" EQ profile this pedal is known for. The Fat switch enhances the gain characteristics with a different transistor clipping stage which emulates a clear, organic, boutique-amp like tone. SPECIFICATIONS Volume: Controls the total output volume. Gain: Adjusts the total amount of gain that is applied, turning this control clockwise will increase the amount. Tone: Adjust the amount of low-end / high-end frequencies, turning clockwise will increase the levels, counter clockwise to decrease. Voice Mode Switch: Select between two distinct voices - Left is stock, Right is enhanced clarity. Fat Mode Switch: Engage Fat mode - Left is stock, Right alters the clipping and gain profile. Power: This pedal was designed around the usage of a 9-18V DC power source SKU: I718446-N-2-WHXA UPC: 763815133355 Video Date &#x25BC;&#x25B2; Maker &#x25BC;&#x25B2; Video &#x25BC;&#x25B2; Time &#x25BC;&#x25B2; 2023-07-17 BuzzbeeTV [EffectorTimes 883회] Perfect Pairing #11: Marshall Bluesbreaker & Wampler Moxie 24:40 2022-10-28 TheGuitarGeek Wampler Moxie: OVERDUE REVIEW SHOOTOUT - Moxie vs Two Ibanez Tubescreamers TS-10 & TS-7 27:10 2022-10-11 Alberto Barrero Wampler MOXIE Overdrive - Music & Demo by A.Barrero 7:29 2022-09-24 Jack Fossett Wampler Moxie 10:14 2022-09-12 BuzzbeeTV [EffectorTimes 760회] Wampler 이펙터 Moxie 14:54 2022-08-09 Sweetwater Sound Wampler Moxie Overdrive Pedal Demo 5:43 2022-08-09 Burgerman666 Wampler: MOXIE Overdrive 7:35 2022-08-09 Mike 