        {
          "url": "https://www.wamplerpedals.com/products/distortion-overdrive/pinnacle-deluxe-v2/",
          "host": "www.wamplerpedals.com",
          "title": "Pinnacle Deluxe v2 | Wampler Pedals",
          "h1": "Pinnacle Deluxe v2",
          "description": "The Pinnacle Deluxe v2. From the Brown Sound to classic rock. From amp overdrive to screaming metal, you CAN have it all!",
          "snippet": "Pinnacle Deluxe v2 - Wampler Pedals",
          "bodyExcerpt": "Pinnacle Deluxe v2 | Wampler Pedals Home Shop All Pedals Distortion / Overdrive Compression Fuzz Delay / Reverb Modulation Boost Utilities Discontinued Plugins Merchandise Dealers Community Blog Artists Podcast Videos Support About Downloads FAQs Warranty Registration Withdrawal Request Contact Us search account_circle My Account search Products search Pinnacle Deluxe v2 Building on the foundations of the Pinnacle Standard and the original Deluxe, we are proud to bring to you the v2 of our biggest selling distortion pedal, the Pinnacle Deluxe. In stock Pinnacle Deluxe v2 quantity Add to cart Watch video Overview Features Videos Technical Downloads In stock Pinnacle Deluxe v2 quantity Add to cart &#8220;I&#8217;ve played tons of pedals that promised that &#8220;Brown Sound&#8221;&#8230; this pedal NAILS it better than anything&#8230;&#8221; &#8211; Zeke Clark, former tech for Eddie Van Halen&#8221; Front | Left facing | Back | Right facing | Top |' data-navmenu=\"off\" data-hashurl=\"off\" data-menuSlider=\"off\" data-continue-autoplay=\"off\" data-outside-nav=\"off\" data-autoplay=\"off\" > 4 5 We took everything we loved about the original and added many options to make the pedal more versatile. Before now, the Deluxe was the same as the standard but with the boost on the stomp instead of a switch. The v2 comes with a new EQ, more control and much more versatility. The first thing you’ll notice is the 3 band EQ. With this, you will be able to sculpt your tone like never before. We’ve also added bright and bass boosts, so you can get that fresh tone or the thump of a 4x12”. Then, we added the “Valve Screamer” based pre gain boost (that you can use when the pedal is bypassed) – we all know how good this style of circuit pushes gain stages… Then, the secret weapon. On the side is the SAG switch. This can allow you to remove that saggy crunch and tighten the response up dramatically, so – this v2 offers not only an updated take on a Wampler classic, but also a plethora of new features that will be irresistible to tone chasers everywhere! The Pinnacle Deluxe v2. From the Brown Sound to classic rock. From amp overdrive to screaming metal, you CAN have it all! &#36; 239.97 In stock Pinnacle Deluxe v2 quantity Add to cart SKU: WMP-PDO-PED Category: Distortion / Overdrive Tag: distortion warning Cancer and Reproductive Harm www.p65warnings.ca.gov task_alt A Modern Classic Based on the now legendary Pinnacle Standard, we took the tones available from that and exploded them. Not only wil it nail the Brown Sound, but with the separate boost, expanded EQ and SAG switch, all the tones are there waiting to be screamed through your amp. task_alt Complete Control Bringing in a legendary Wampler 3 band active EQ, separate stomp boost (TS based) and a SAG control to tame those high powered pickups., everything extra you wanted in the standard is now available in the Deluxe. task_alt Vintage and Modern In the Vintage mode you can chase those classic rock distorted tones that are all about organic power, in the Modern mode the aggression comes forward and your tone can cut through any mix. task_alt Built for Forever Brian Wampler’s attention to detail and commitment to bringing you the best-sounding &#038; most usable Effects Boxes on the market is nothing new. Those qualities are on full display within the Pinnacle Deluxe. We’re all tone-freaks, and we’re always trying new things, but we hope this pedal finds it’s forever home on your pedalboard, so we built it to last that long. See it in action: Technical Details Built in the U.S.A. High grade components picked for their superior sound and response Top mounted input and output jacks Battery connection and 9v power jack Power draw: between 19mA (9v) and 23mA (18v) (LED will flash 3 times when power from battery is getting low) High gain, crunchy and dynamic pedal with an extremely tweakable EQ Valuable pre gain boost that works separately from the main circuit 3.5″ x 4.5″ x 1.5″ (88.9mm x 114.3mm x 38.1mm)",
