        {
          "url": "https://www.wamplerpedals.com/products/discontinued/sovereign-distortion/",
          "host": "www.wamplerpedals.com",
          "title": "Sovereign Distortion | Wampler Pedals",
          "h1": "Sovereign Distortion",
          "description": "We took apart what is required for a great distortion and when we put all the parts back together, we discovered that not only was Brian the King of Dirt, but his new circuit was the King. The Sovereign.",
          "snippet": "Sovereign Distortion - Wampler Pedals",
          "bodyExcerpt": "Sovereign Distortion | Wampler Pedals Home Shop All Pedals Distortion / Overdrive Compression Fuzz Delay / Reverb Modulation Boost Utilities Discontinued Plugins Merchandise Dealers Community Blog Artists Podcast Videos Support About Downloads FAQs Warranty Registration Withdrawal Request Contact Us search account_circle My Account search Products search DISCONTINUED Sovereign Distortion To many people, pedals such as the Euphoria and Plexi-Drive projected Brian Wampler well on the way to be the king of dirt. This inspired him to create the all powerful sovereign of dirt. Out of stock Watch video Overview Features Videos Technical Downloads Out of stock Front | Left facing | Back | Right facing | Top |' data-navmenu=\"off\" data-hashurl=\"off\" data-menuSlider=\"off\" data-continue-autoplay=\"off\" data-outside-nav=\"off\" data-autoplay=\"off\" > 4 5 We took apart what is required for a great distortion and when we put all the parts back together, we discovered that not only was Brian the King of Dirt, but his new circuit was the King. The Sovereign. The distortion available from the Sovereign is so versatile you will wonder how so much can be available from one small box. Two gain stages, a mid contour, bright switch and tone control allow you to dial in virtually any sound from modern distortion all the way back to classic OD tones. With the pedigree this pedal has, we wanted to make sure it stands tall among the other heroes of dirt. We think the Sovereign is the finest in its class, and with a versatility you won’t find on another pedal that sounds as organic as the Sovereign, you’ll agree that this truly is the Sovereign of distortion. &#36; 199.97 Out of stock SKU: WMP-SDS-PED Category: Discontinued Tag: distortion warning Cancer and Reproductive Harm www.p65warnings.ca.gov task_alt Distortion, defined Many pedals offer you the ultimate kind of distortion, but very few can offer you almost anything. Great distortion is hard to find, great distortion is hard to control, so we bring the Sovereign – the monarch of distortion pedals, the only one you would ever need. task_alt Complete Control As well as having a regular tone control, the Sovereign also includes a Contour control that can give you total control of your EQ – if you like it scooped, it’s there – if you like it with a mid hump, it’s there… task_alt Vintage and Modern In the Vintage mode you can chase those classic rock distorted tones that are all about organic power, in the Modern mode the aggression comes forward and your tone can cut through any mix. task_alt Built for Forever Brian Wampler’s attention to detail and commitment to bringing you the best-sounding &#038; most usable Effects Boxes on the market is nothing new. Those qualities are on full display within the Sovereign. We’re all tone-freaks, and we’re always trying new things, but we hope this pedal finds it’s forever home on your pedalboard, so we built it to last that long. See it in action: Technical Details Built in the U.S.A. High grade components picked for their superior sound and response Relay true bypass with soft switch Top mounted input and output jacks Battery connection and 9v power jack Power draw: Between 9mA (9v) and 17mA (18v) (LED will flash 3 times when power from battery is getting low) High gain, crunchy and dynamic pedal Extremely tweakable EQ Advanced Gain Structure, amazing array of sounds 2.5″ x 4.5″ x 1.5″ (63.5mm x 114.3mm x 38.1mm) – height excludes knobs and switches Includes Wampler’s limited 5-year warranty 5 Year Limited Warranty Each Wampler product that bears the official “Wampler – Built in USA” logo is custom designed and assembled in the USA using premium globally sourced components chosen for superior sound and response. Each pedal comes complete with Wampler’s 5 year limited warranty – we stand by our products so you can stomp on them! Register Product Want to take your tone to the next level? We've got distortions that will go from a hard rock rumble to full on face melt",
