          "bodyExcerpt": "Way Huge Smalls GREEN RHINO MkV - Overdrive (WM22) - 710137122215 Skip Navigation Website Accessibility Toggle navigation &#9776; Menu Menu Home Electrics Fender Fender Custom Shop Gibson Gibson Custom Shop Charvel Jackson Gretsch Nash Epiphone Heritage Guitars Pawar Guitars Reverend Eastman Shop All Acoustics Martin Gibson Epiphone Shop All Basses Fender Nash Gibson Charvel Pedals Amplifiers Fender Victoria Magnatone Gibson Vox Shop All Accessories Capos Cases Pickups Shop All Used Gear Used Guitars Used Amps About Store Policies Synchrony Gibson Promo T-Shirts Repairs Gift Cards Login Way Huge Smalls GREEN RHINO MkV - Overdrive (WM22) Way Huge Smalls GREEN RHINO MkV - Overdrive (WM22) WAY HUGE SMALLS GREEN RHINO MkV - OVERDRIVE (WM22) THIS LITTLE PACHYDERM PACKS A HUGE PUNCH! The Way Huge Green Rhino Overdrive MkV is the smallest of the herd, but it unleashes a stampede of gnarly, gritty tones that rivals its larger companions&rsquo;. The Volume, Tone, and Drive controls cover the basic functions, while the Freq and Curve controls offer finer adjustment of your beastly sonic yield. The Freq control cuts or boosts at either 100Hz or 500Hz&mdash;set internally&mdash;while the Curve control allows you to soften the creature&rsquo;s roar if it gets too aggressive on the high end. With this level of versatility, you can take any amp from pristine to punchy, from dirty to thunderous. This pedal will have your amp showing a whole new side of itself. THE LONG STORY The Way Huge Green Rhino Overdrive MkV is the smallest of the herd, but it unleashes a stampede of gnarly, gritty tones that rivals its larger companions'. The Volume, Tone, and Drive controls cover the basic functions, while the Freq and Curve controls offer finer adjustment of your beastly sonic yield. The Freq control cuts or boosts at either 100Hz or 500Hz&mdash;set internally&mdash;while the Curve control allows you to soften the creature's roar if it gets too aggressive on the high end. With this level of versatility, you can take any amp from pristine to punchy, from dirty to thunderous. This pedal will have your amp showing a whole new side of itself. EXTERNAL CONTROLS: VOLUME KNOB - adjusts output level DRIVE KNOB - adjusts overdrive intensity TONE KNOB - adjusts EQ from warm to bright CURVE KNOB - tames aggressive highs FREQ KNOB - cuts or boosts at 500Hz or 100Hz (as set by internal switch) Newsletter Signup Mollis dictum imperdiet dictum orn. Repeat Email Address: Home | Electrics | Acoustics | Basses | Pedals | Amplifiers | Accessories | Used Gear | About | Store Policies | T-Shirts | Repairs | Gift Cards | Site Map Copyright &copy; 2007-2026 - Guitar Riot, LLC. Website Design by MusicShop360 var knobby = JSON.parse('{\"bin_location\":false,\"bulk\":true,\"module_canonical\":true,\"customer_notes\":false,\"dumbbell_labels\":true,\"email_customization\":true,\"layaway\":true,\"newsletter_archive\":true,\"polls\":false,\"product_download\":true,\"product_form\":true,\"product_kit\":true,\"product_offline_reserve\":true,\"product_serialized\":true,\"allow_subscriptions_settings\":true,\"product_suggested\":true,\"product_transfer\":true,\"product_wait_list\":true,\"product_yards\":false,\"quotes\":true,\"repairs\":true,\"rto_school_info\":true,\"services\":true,\"so\":true,\"packages\":true,\"till_quick_pick\":false,\"taxjar\":false,\"shopify\":false,\"web_checkout\":true,\"website_file_upload\":true,\"website_forms\":true,\"website_customer_directory\":true,\"website_store_locator\":true,\"scuba_store\":false,\"module_website\":true,\"module_email\":true,\"module_products\":true,\"module_classes\":true,\"module_packages\":true,\"module_class_packages\":false,\"module_enhancedCategoryPage\":true,\"module_pos\":true,\"module_spreadsheetUpload\":true,\"module_wholesaleLogin\":false,\"module_designWall\":false,\"module_facebookFeatures\":false,\"module_gallery\":true,\"module_allcosts\":false,\"module_rental\":false,\"module_txtMsg\":true,