        {
          "url": "https://www.firehouseguitars.com/product/22844357/way-huge-wm81-smalls-stone-burner-sub-atomic-fuzz-effects-pedal/",
          "host": "www.firehouseguitars.com",
          "title": "Way Huge WM81 Smalls Stone Burner Sub Atomic Fuzz Effects Pedal | Firehouse Guitars",
          "h1": "",
          "description": "Playing with the Way Huge Stone Burner Sub Atomic Fuzz is like playing with molten lava—it’s all fun and games until somebody gets scorched. But that’s the whole point with this dastardly little box. The Way Huge Smalls Stone Burner Sub Atomic Fuzz will put you in touch with your freaky side. It’ll have you threatening the world with searing fuzz in one moment and generating earth-shaking low end in the next. It’ll unleash sonic blasts that roar at the heavens like pillars of terra-cotta glow that hide the stars... The fuzz and sub octave signals each have their own level knobs so that you can mix the two to your own twisted taste. The Sub 1/Sub 2 switch lets you choose just how low your dirty deeds can go. Volume and Tone controls round out this pedal’s insidious interface. Mr. Huge designed the Stone Burner Sub Atomic Fuzz as your all-purpose companion—bring it along for everything from robot mating season to skullduggery in the Mojave Desert. Have some fun, and explore the outer reaches of your sanity. Fire up the Way Huge Smalls Stone Burner Sub Atomic Fuzz, and get weird. But remember to protect your eyes...",
          "snippet": "Way Huge WM81 Smalls Stone Burner Sub Atomic Fuzz Effects Pedal",
          "bodyExcerpt": "Way Huge WM81 Smalls Stone Burner Sub Atomic Fuzz Effects Pedal | Firehouse Guitars Home Used Repairs Lessons Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask! Guitars Basses Pedals Effects Amps Drums Keys Synths Live Sound Recording Retail Used Gear Repairs Plek Lessons Rentals About Us Way Huge WM81 Smalls Stone Burner Sub Atomic Fuzz Effects Pedal $ 179.99 Color: Gray Got Questions? Add to Cart Free Pickup from Grandville Ships from Grandville, West Michigan Warehouse All Way Huge All Instrument Signal Processors All Effects Pedals Playing with the Way Huge Stone Burner Sub Atomic Fuzz is like playing with molten lava—it’s all fun and games until somebody gets scorched. But that’s the whole point with this dastardly little box. The Way Huge Smalls Stone Burner Sub Atomic Fuzz will put you in touch with your freaky side. It’ll have you threatening the world with searing fuzz in one moment and generating earth-shaking low end in the next. It’ll unleash sonic blasts that roar at the heavens like pillars of terra-cotta glow that hide the stars... The fuzz and sub octave signals each have their own level knobs so that you can mix the two to your own twisted taste. The Sub 1/Sub 2 switch lets you choose just how low your dirty deeds can go. Volume and Tone controls round out this pedal’s insidious interface. Mr. Huge designed the Stone Burner Sub Atomic Fuzz as your all-purpose companion—bring it along for everything from robot mating season to skullduggery in the Mojave Desert. Have some fun, and explore the outer reaches of your sanity. Fire up the Way Huge Smalls Stone Burner Sub Atomic Fuzz, and get weird. But remember to protect your eyes... Features Combines a gnarly-sounding fuzz with subterranean sub-octave effects Churns out an endless array of ferocious — and downright freaky — tones Sub 1/Sub 2 switch toggles between 1- and 2-octave-down sub-octaves Separate Sub and Fuzz knobs call up the perfect blend of sub-octave and fuzzed-out signals Tone knob ranges from a warm-sounding crunch to an ear-splitting grind Volume knob controls your overall output Specifications Batteries 1 x 9V Dimensions 1.75&quot; H x 2.25&quot; W x 3.62&quot; D EQ Tone Control Effects Fuzz, Octave Features Battery-Powered Inputs 1 x 1/4&quot; MPN WM81 Outputs 1 x 1/4&quot; Power Source 9V DC power supply (sold separately) Power Usage 8mA Processing Type Analog UPC 0000710137134829 Questions? We Can Help! ✉️ Email Us 🏴 4611 Ivanrest Ave SW; Grandville, MI 49418 📞 (616) 532-3473 4611 Ivanrest Ave SW Grandville, MI 49418 (616) 532-3473 info@firehouseguitars.com Company Our Family Story Meet The Team Showroom Tour Store Events Brands We Carry Service Shipping Policy Return Exchange Policy Pricing Policy Privacy Policy Gift Card Balance Repairs Connect With Us Sign up get the latest and greatest Join © 2026 Firehouse Guitars [[\"ShallowReactive\",1],{\"data\":2,\"state\":57,\"once\":74,\"_errors\":75,\"serverRendered\":72,\"path\":77,\"pinia\":78},[\"ShallowReactive\",3],{\"strapi-ribbon-navigation-cache\":4,\"product-page-cache\":26,\"brand-1462-cache\":33},{\"reminderText\":5,\"headingColor\":6,\"linkColor\":6,\"textColor\":6,\"createdAt\":7,\"updatedAt\":8,\"links\":9},\"**Welcome To The Family | Have Questions, Just Ask!**\",null,\"2026-03-05T22:11:40.941Z\",\"2026-06-19T15:20:45.760Z\",[10,14,18,22],{\"id\":11,\"URL\":12,\"title\":13},26,\"\\u002F\",\"Home\",{\"id\":15,\"URL\":16,\"title\":17},29,\"\\u002Fused\\u002F\",\"Used\",{\"