          "h1": "WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ STONE BURNER™ SUB ATOMIC FUZZ",
          "description": "wm81, way huge smalls stone burner sub atomic fuzz, way huge, way huge smalls, fuzz pedal, atomic fuzz, guitar pedal, jim dunlop, guitar pedal, effects pedal, stompbox, guitar effects",
          "snippet": "WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ STONE BURNER™ SUB ATOMIC FUZZ - Dunlop",
          "bodyExcerpt": "WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ STONE BURNER™ SUB ATOMIC FUZZ Toggle menu Compare --> Register I Sign in Search Bag Search Close Products --> All Products --> --> Electronics MXR Cry Baby Way Huge Dunlop Electronics Authentic Hendrix Pedal Parts Electronic Parts Legacy Products Guitar Picks Tortex Nylon Max-Grip Jazz Herco Gator Grip Celluloid Ultex Primetone Delrin 500 Flow Finger Thumb Stubby Variety Packs Artist Series Graphic Artist Series Pick Tins Other Clearance Accessories Capos Slides Tonebars MXR Cables Care Maintenance Strap Retainer Straps Tuners Pick Holders GrooveTech Tools Accu-Fret Fretwire Clearance Strings Artist Series Electric Bass Acoustic Classical Americana Ukulele Apparel Shirts Hoodies Hats Artists Lifestyle Sign in WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ STONE BURNER™ SUB ATOMIC FUZZ WM81 Description *LEGACY PRODUCT / NO LONGER IN PRODUCTION This pedal combines ferocious fuzz and thunderous sub octave signals to put you in touch with your freaky side. Warranty Information Product Demo The Long Story Playing with the Way Huge Stone Burner Sub Atomic Fuzz is like playing with molten lava—it’s all fun and games until somebody gets scorched. But that’s the whole point with this dastardly little box. The Way Huge Smalls Stone Burner Sub Atomic Fuzz will put you in touch with your freaky side. It’ll have you threatening the world with searing fuzz in one moment and generating earth-shaking low end in the next. It’ll unleash sonic blasts that roar at the heavens like pillars of terra-cotta glow that hide the stars... The fuzz and sub octave signals each have their own level knobs so that you can mix the two to your own twisted taste. The Sub 1/Sub 2 switch lets you choose just how low your dirty deeds can go. Volume and Tone controls round out this pedal’s insidious interface. Mr. Huge designed the Stone Burner Sub Atomic Fuzz as your all-purpose companion—bring it along for everything from robot mating season to skullduggery in the Mojave Desert. Have some fun, and explore the outer reaches of your sanity. Fire up the Way Huge Smalls Stone Burner Sub Atomic Fuzz, and get weird. But remember to protect your eyes... Feed Product Manual Current Stock: atc-product: 2309 atc-product: 2307 atc-product: 1987 Related Gear Add to Bag MXR® 15 FT COIL GLOW INSTRUMENT CABLE - RIGHT / STRAIGHT DCICG15R $36.74 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Add to Bag MXR® 15 FT COIL CABLE BLACK - RIGHT / STRAIGHT DCICB15R $30.44 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Add to Bag MXR® 18-INCH RIBBON PATCH CABLE DCPR018 $12.59 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Out of stock MXR® 3 INCH RIBBON PATCH CABLE - 3 PACK 3PDCPR03 $20.99 Add to Bag MXR® 6 IN PATCH CABLE - 1 PACK DCP06SI $10.49 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Add to Bag MXR® 3 FT PATCH CABLE DCP3 $15.74 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Out of stock MXR® 6 IN PATCH CABLE 3-PACK 3PDCP06 $20.99 &#215; OK About Careers Contact Site Feedback Support Store Locator Gear Support My Account Product Registration Custom Picks Legal Statement of Accessibility Copyrights Trademarks Terms Conditions Icon Agreement Contest Rules Popular Brands MXR CRY BABY DUNLOP ELECTRONICS MXR BASS INNOVATIONS MXR CUSTOM SHOP WAY HUGE CRYBABY DUNLOP JIM DUNLOP CAE View All --> STAY IN TOUCH. &copy; 2026 Dunlop Manufacturing, Inc.",
